flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Build query by email and password]
    B --> C[Open DB connection]
    C --> D[Bind email and password]
    D --> E[Execute query]
    E --> F{User found?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Store user_id in object]
    G --> H[Return true]
    F -- No --> I[Return false]
    C --> J[On SQL error print stack trace]
    J --> I
    H --> K[End]
    I --> K
